{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55971","headline":"赠狄涣 · 廖融","name":"赠狄涣","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"高卧白云乡，崖泉对阁凉。\n守贫无属道，多病数求方。\n耕犊惊雷毙，寒芜入圃荒。\n如何帝未梦，吟若顶铺霜。\n（同前）（按：王正己、廖衡等人爲五代末至宋初居住於湖南衡山一带的诗人，今可考知诸人事迹均已入宋，然历来皆视爲五代作者，故仍予以收录。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"廖融","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55971.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55971","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}